cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "BayesHalvingSearchCV & PatternSearchCV"
abstract: >-
  Scikit-learn-compatible hyperparameter search estimators — a from-scratch
  Bayesian (Gaussian Process + Expected Improvement) search and a
  Hooke-Jeeves pattern search — sharing one multi-fidelity "bullseye"
  data-growth mechanism and one scatter-search multi-start layer, for
  faster hyperparameter tuning on large datasets.
authors:
